 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "What if Earth spun faster, and couldn't stop?",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 3.51,
   "sha256": "209ecebc112234fdf15c0f216616445371fc5da8258606adeb4de6682870da1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "s2",
   "text": "You're standing on the equator, and you'll watch what happens minute by minute, until the planet can't take it anymore.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 5.11,
   "sha256": "ec15874242b45254e69214a9f25d6678a0f99a77290b2ee2c5daeb6476d76635"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "s3",
   "text": "The Earth keeps its size, its air and its water.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 2.76,
   "sha256": "844db338411129c6e438e178fb82fb10479036ae72f935cb7e943f7a66b153b3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "s4",
   "text": "Only the spin changes, and it only gets faster.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 2.38,
   "sha256": "0bbedec77c87fd0645f3bb1c6de8da6535b1157a4e86be643fff75a12712bc1a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "s5",
   "text": "One number matters: the length of a day.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 1.975,
   "sha256": "f0cce87532a452367c266b0fef990ad250328517d11f5bac5b786a9e1109f783"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "s6",
   "text": "It starts at twenty-four hours and ends at about an hour and twenty-four minutes.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 3.58,
   "sha256": "21f11aeb5fd9dbfcd6cafbbb9cd1dc8ab22be773140c1e091bc234b39c65f5f8"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "s7",
   "text": "Under it, how fast the ground moves under your feet.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 2.26,
   "sha256": "fe8e20a3d739b399d84819e967771e44213ce28276690fd8bd0ecda52bdbc312"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "s8",
   "text": "Nothing resets.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 1.0,
   "sha256": "1a1ac6a26cd92da76d894fa5a620f87bb939036f7e4344aafdcca376438de670"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "s9",
   "text": "Nothing slows.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 0.86,
   "sha256": "f1acb813befaaf86ce143be0e83027b4266798e89f2919c1f450cbce83d5701d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "s10",
   "text": "Treat every number as a first guess.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 1.65,
   "sha256": "d50a1a59f3a02073f26ad5a11b4bbe11660be3cf041dac07e2e3348dd55c2c2a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "s11",
   "text": "Right now the ground carries you at about sixteen hundred and seventy kilometers an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 4.54,
   "sha256": "a17c6dc84052400b28507ab35db978f3b22dcfb0d032121b05f806645e3feac3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "beat": "s12",
   "text": "What you feel is a tiny push outward: the spin makes you about a third of a percent lighter.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "12.wav",
   "dur": 4.83,
   "sha256": "3256b870d8c6489740d2c8ba9f8607a235db79fa84ec7a26e805516c9f2c3c3f"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo13",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "13.wav",
   "dur": 5.11,
   "sha256": "e4527cfda3ba53e27b28101ffb005b988c52d0b5303f8e46e603f9aa22aa6f3e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo14",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And then the spin has only just begun to speed up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "14.wav",
   "dur": 3.43,
   "sha256": "56107facdd38922e10f1d7f0e50b0de27f03ac04d13759495380112647fbe01d"
  },
  {
